  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Configuration-bindable settings for hosted resilient-task storage.
            The inherited credential and <see cref="P:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.Tasks.ResilientTaskSettings.Endpoint" /> are resolved from one configuration
            section so task-storage identity and location cannot be configured independently.
            Binding storage settings does not enable the resilient-task runtime; call
            <see cref="M:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.Tasks.ResilientTaskEnablementExtensions.SetResilientTasksEnabled(Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.IHostApplicationBuilder,System.Boolean)" />
            before host startup.
            </summary>
